{"seq":40,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r4-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-11-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T02:12:43.357Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3600764cb2e94b95f55e38d83bd42c1f22774f8a1296dfbfee89502bdbceaa8b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"Hi Hollis, here's what I could find for Marrow Fieldworks:\n\n*Gatehouse Check-In report timeout, Salina North: ticket #4409*\nThis comes from Moss's \"Central handoffs next week\" digest (public, 2 Jan 2026). It says the report kept timing out at the Salina North yard, specifically at Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron during the 06:00 flatbed intake. You flagged it as an open ticket on Pree's dealer account before Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on Mon 5 Jan 2026. You flagged #4412 alongside it, a minor driver SMS prompt glitch when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots. I haven't found any later update or resolution on #4409.\n\n*West yard Door 2 double-booking: ticket #8841*\nTobias mentioned this in #central-random on 13 Oct 2026. You'd asked whether the webhook patch fixed the tractor-bay alerts on \"Tobias's dealer account.\" He said he'd checked the Plains depots, Door 2 was still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk, and he'd flagged it to support on #8841. I haven't seen anything since.\n\nOne thing to check: nothing I can see actually says \"Marrow Fieldworks\" next to #8841. I'm assuming it's the same dealer account because it moved from Pree on 5 Jan and Tobias now calls it his dealer account. Worth confirming with Tobias before it goes in the file."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000130"}}
